      "field": "abilities",
      "content": [
        {
          "skill_id": 31200,
          "type": "Passive",
          "name": "violent rhythm",
          "desc": "Passive: After Shen Mengxi's skill hits an enemy, it will ignite it. The ignited enemy will be exposed to vision for 3 seconds; hitting the ignited enemy with a normal attack will trigger an explosion, causing 100 (+16% spell bonus) magic damage to nearby enemies. Shen Mengxi recovers 3 bombs when she resurrects after death.",
          "cd": "0",
          "cost": "0",
          "tags": [
            "Vision",
            "Speed Up"
          ],
          "icon": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/312/31200.png"
        },
        {
          "skill_id": 31201,
          "type": "Skill 1",
          "name": "cat bomb",
          "desc": "While Shen Mengxi is charging, she throws a cat bomb at the target location every 0.75 seconds. After exploding, it will cause 340/390/440/490/540/590 (+40% spell bonus) magic damage to enemies within the range. Shen Mengxi has a total of 10 bombs; each throw consumes 1 bomb, and up to 5 bombs can be thrown continuously; bombs are acquired every 5 seconds, affected by cooling; self-ignition state: the cat bomb will lock the enemy, and will knock the enemy back after hitting it, causing 360/408/456/504/552/600 (+40% spell bonus) spell damage. At the same time, the bomb will continue to bounce forward and fall to the ground for a certain distance, causing another 405/459/513/567/621/675 (+45% spell bonus) spell damage.",
          "cd": "3",
          "cost": "Ammo consumption: 1",
          "tags": [
            "Damage",
            "Bombardment",
            "Slow"
          ],
          "icon": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/312/31210.png"
        },
        {
          "skill_id": 31202,
          "type": "Skill 2",
          "name": "normal operation",
          "desc": "Ignite a bomb, increase movement speed by 70/76/82/88/94/100% and continue to decay. Within 5 seconds, you can actively detonate the bomb and sprint in the specified direction. At the same time, enemies on the path will be stunned for 0.75 seconds and cause 500/560/620/680/740/800 (+65% Magical Attack) magic damage. If there is no active detonation during the spontaneous combustion period, the flame will extinguish after 5 seconds and a bomb will be returned. During the period of spontaneous combustion, the throwing method and cooling of [Cat Bomb] will change.",
          "cd": "12/11.5/11/10.5/10/9.5",
          "cost": "Ammo consumption: 1",
          "tags": [
            "Speed Up",
            "Movement",
            "Stun"
          ],
          "icon": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/312/31220.png"
        },
        {
          "skill_id": 31203,
          "type": "Skill 3",
          "name": "Comprehensive hot items",
          "desc": "After charging, throw a mixed bomb to cause 500/700/900 (+50% Magical Attack) magic damage to the enemy, and cause 250/350/450 (+25% Magical Attack) magic damage within 2 seconds. At the same time, it splits 3 cat bombs and scatters around, causing 250/350/450 (+25% Magical Attack) magic damage to the enemy. A hybrid bomb is obtained every 50 seconds, and a maximum of 2 bombs can be stored. The acquisition speed is affected by the cooldown.",
          "cd": "5",
          "cost": "Ammo consumption: 0",
          "tags": [
            "Long Range",
            "Damage",
            "AoE"
          ],
          "icon": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/312/31230.png"
        },
